WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:00.834
Alex Marquardt

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.085
is OUTFRONT in Kiev tonight

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.169
to begin our coverage.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:03.670
And Alex,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.421
what is the latest

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.381
on the ground there tonight?

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:09.551
Aaron, we are seeing the beginning stages

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.803
of this new Russian offensive and so far

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.471
it is not going well.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.139
One senior

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:14.556
State Department

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.765
official on Thursday

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:18.101
said that it is very pathetic.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.478
We are getting that update

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:21.521
on the fighting in back

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.773
moved from the White House, that city

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:25.442
where for the past few months,

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.568
Ukraine has been locked

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:28.236
in a fierce battle

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.487
with Russian forces

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:30.697
from the Virginia group

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.949
made up of mercenaries and convicts.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.035
The White House is John Kirby saying that

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.286
in December.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:39.247
90% of the deaths from Virginia

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:40.415
were convicts,

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.332
a recruitment tool,

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:43.752
he says that shows no sign of abating.

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:45.170
Plus,

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.797
just a week from the first anniversary

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.215
of the Russian invasion.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.259
This is according to President Vladimir.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.387
The toughest fight in Ukraine right now

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.723
in the eastern city of Bermuda

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.225
called a meat grinder by both sides.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.226
Russian troops

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.978
from the Wagner mercenary group,

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:03.313
most of them convicts,

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.190
continue to be sent in

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.442
wave after wave to their deaths.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:09.903
Men that he just plucked out of prisons

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:10.987
and threw on a battlefield

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:13.448
with no training, no equipping,

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:14.949
no organization or command,

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.534
just throw him into the fight.

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:18.661
90% killed were convicts.

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:19.871
We believe that Wagner continues

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:21.081
to rely heavily

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.040
on these convicts

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:22.916
in the back fighting,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:23.917
and that doesn't show

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.585
any signs of abating.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.169
The battle

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:27.045
laying bare,

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:29.089
the stark divisions on the Russian side.

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:31.549
You would get a common video button

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.968
with Bognor chief Evgeny Prigozhin

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.345
openly blasting

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.930
Russia's official military

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.764
leadership,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.599
saying they managed soldiers

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.351
from beauty salons and country

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:42.727
clubs, arguing

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:43.686
that if there were more

00:01:43.686 --> 00:01:45.105
of his private troops,

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.606
they would be halfway across

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.399
Ukraine by now.

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:50.068
The toll has been so severe

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.277
on the Russian side

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:51.820
that according

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.071
to Ukrainian officials,

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.030
regular troops

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:55.824
have been back filling Wagner

00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:56.950
mechanized infantry

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.034
and tank units

00:01:58.034 --> 00:02:00.203
supported by artillery and aircraft.

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.705
If Russia were to take back mud,

00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:03.832
it would change little

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:05.959
but be a symbolic victory

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.169
as Ukraine struggles to keep them at bay.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:10.255
President

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:11.923
Zelensky today urging world

00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:14.008
leaders at the Munich Security Conference

00:02:14.008 --> 00:02:16.094
to speed up their military aid

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:17.971
comparing the fight to Goliath,

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.889
taking on David and his sling.

00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:21.432
We need to hurry up.

00:02:21.432 --> 00:02:23.184
We need the speed,

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:25.061
speed of our agreements,

00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:26.521
speed of our delivery

00:02:26.521 --> 00:02:27.355
to strengthen

00:02:27.355 --> 00:02:31.401
our slowing speed of decisions to limit

00:02:31.401 --> 00:02:34.112
Russian potential

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.489
that Russian potential

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.782
is still significant,

00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:39.242
with hundreds of thousands

00:02:39.242 --> 00:02:40.285
of mobilized troops

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:41.911
believed to be in reserve.

00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:43.621
And Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:02:43.621 --> 00:02:45.248
able to call up more

00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:47.375
to offset his enormous losses.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.960
Now, according to the U.S.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.836
State Department,

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:50.670
numbering over

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.590
200,000 Russian dead and wounded

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.216
We should note that

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:56.467
Ukraine has also suffered

00:02:56.467 --> 00:02:57.427
tremendous losses

00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:58.636
both in this fight and Mahmud

00:02:58.636 --> 00:02:59.596
and all across the country

00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:00.430
over the past year.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:01.931
But Ukraine and the U.S.

00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:04.267
are less transparent about those numbers.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.269
Now, the United States would like to see

00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.061
Ukraine shift

00:03:07.061 --> 00:03:08.313
its focus from back mount

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:09.189
to a looming

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.232
counter-offensive in the south

00:03:11.232 --> 00:03:12.942
that would be made up of some newly

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:15.195
trained troops and armored vehicles.

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:17.989
Today, we learned that 635

00:03:17.989 --> 00:03:19.741
Ukrainian troops have just finished

00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:22.577
a five week training course at a U.S.

00:03:22.577 --> 00:03:23.745
base in Germany.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:26.831
Second phase has now started with 710

00:03:27.081 --> 00:03:28.666
new Ukrainian troops.

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:29.459
Much of the training

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:32.003
focus on combined arms and maneuvers

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.005
with those armored vehicles that the U.S.

00:03:34.005 --> 00:03:35.215
believes will be critical

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.967
in taking back territory from Russia.

00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:39.135
Alex, thank you very much,

00:03:39.135 --> 00:03:39.969
from Kiev tonight.

00:03:39.969 --> 00:03:41.804
And OUTFRONT now, Michael Bociurkiw,

00:03:41.804 --> 00:03:42.555
the senior fellow

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:43.681
at the Atlantic Council,

00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:45.225
He is based in the southern Ukrainian

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.351
city of Odessa.

00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:48.102
And retired Air Force Colonel

00:03:48.102 --> 00:03:48.937
Cedric Leighton.

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:50.647
Thanks so much to both of you.

00:03:50.647 --> 00:03:51.189
Colonel Leighton,

00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:52.232
let me just start with you.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:52.857
Where

00:03:52.857 --> 00:03:54.609
what with what Alex was saying,

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:55.568
that Russia is struggling

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.486
to get a new offensive

00:03:56.486 --> 00:03:57.946
going, a battered military,

00:03:57.946 --> 00:03:59.447
the tremendous losses, obviously,

00:03:59.447 --> 00:04:01.783
from Wagner being a part of that.

00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:04.452
What would a massive Russian offensive

00:04:04.452 --> 00:04:06.829
look like with the military

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:08.122
that they have now?

00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:08.373
You know,

00:04:08.373 --> 00:04:09.666
presuming that they have

00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:11.292
tens of thousands or more

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:13.336
troops that they're

00:04:13.336 --> 00:04:15.255
about to commit to it.

00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:18.132
Yeah, Erin, that's really interesting.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:19.842
In normal times,

00:04:19.842 --> 00:04:21.261
you would see a Russian offensive

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:22.178
would look

00:04:22.178 --> 00:04:25.807
like a huge massive of soldiers

00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:26.516
going forward

00:04:26.516 --> 00:04:27.100
with locked

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.769
tanks, helicopters and air support.

00:04:30.561 --> 00:04:32.355
The air support is definitely lacking.

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:34.524
It has been lacking so far.

00:04:34.524 --> 00:04:36.651
You also have a situation where there are

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:38.736
really problems back

00:04:38.736 --> 00:04:40.613
showing the losses

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:41.614
that the Russians have had

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:43.574
that Alex mentioned in his report.

00:04:43.574 --> 00:04:45.618
So you're going to see

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.495
probably is this attempt

00:04:47.495 --> 00:04:47.912
to like

00:04:47.912 --> 00:04:48.955
you see in Barbuda

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:51.374
and in other places along the front

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.459
where there are going to be

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.461
these probes that are moving forward.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.379
But those probes

00:04:56.379 --> 00:04:58.047
are not going to be effective

00:04:58.047 --> 00:04:59.716
unless they find certain weaknesses

00:04:59.716 --> 00:05:01.426
in the Ukrainian lines.

00:05:01.426 --> 00:05:02.010
But generally

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.636
speaking, it's going to be an attempt

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.346
with a lot of artillery,

00:05:05.346 --> 00:05:08.099
with a lot of a movement forward.

00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:08.933
But those movements

00:05:08.933 --> 00:05:10.101
are going to be stopped

00:05:10.101 --> 00:05:12.103
pretty much up front line at this point.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:14.022
So, Michael, you know,

00:05:14.022 --> 00:05:14.772
Colonel Leighton says,

00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:15.106
you know,

00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:16.816
you would have a lot of air support

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.109
and there hasn't been that thus far.

00:05:18.109 --> 00:05:19.485
That's true.

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.987
But we do understand that you know,

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:21.696
today in the meeting

00:05:21.696 --> 00:05:24.157
with Alexander Lukashenko,

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.366
Lukashenko promised Putin

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:26.576
that Belarus is ready to produce

00:05:26.576 --> 00:05:27.618
fighter jets for Russia.

00:05:27.618 --> 00:05:29.912
We know from Western intelligence

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:31.039
that they have been

00:05:31.039 --> 00:05:31.873
putting a lot of fighter

00:05:31.873 --> 00:05:34.042
jets on Belarus and bases.

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:34.542
And U.S.

00:05:34.542 --> 00:05:35.543
intelligence is saying

00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:36.461
or Western intelligence

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:37.795
is warning of a massive air assault.

00:05:37.795 --> 00:05:39.172
So it's unclear how that would play in.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.049
But all of those pieces are in place.

00:05:41.049 --> 00:05:42.091
And you say

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:44.427
Russia is currently using balloons

00:05:45.261 --> 00:05:47.221
in some way related to this.

00:05:47.221 --> 00:05:49.015
What more do you know about that? Right.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.433
So from Ukraine, to media

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:51.059
and other sources,

00:05:51.059 --> 00:05:53.478
this is basically a cheap Russian tactic

00:05:53.478 --> 00:05:54.937
to distract Ukrainian radar,

00:05:54.937 --> 00:05:57.106
to confuse its air defense systems

00:05:57.106 --> 00:05:58.483
and to lure the Ukrainians

00:05:58.483 --> 00:05:59.942
into wasting ammunition

00:05:59.942 --> 00:06:01.235
on these balloons.

00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:03.863
But I think what we're seeing is

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:04.989
another attempt

00:06:04.989 --> 00:06:07.450
by Russia to ratchet things up.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.493
And I don't like

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:09.786
to be the bearer of bad news

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:11.204
but I think what we're looking at right

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:12.705
now, Erin, is a

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:13.873
another attempt by Russia

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.375
taking advantage of that gap

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:16.292
between when

00:06:16.292 --> 00:06:18.294
pledges of western tanks were made

00:06:18.294 --> 00:06:20.338
and when the tanks actually arrive

00:06:20.338 --> 00:06:22.507
to do another major assault

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:23.633
from the north,

00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:25.927
from the east and from the south.

00:06:25.927 --> 00:06:28.346
It could be devastating to Ukraine.

00:06:28.346 --> 00:06:30.390
But being in Ukraine as long as I have,

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.599
I know that there's resilience.

00:06:31.599 --> 00:06:32.975
There is very strong.

00:06:32.975 --> 00:06:35.061
The Western weaponry is coming.

00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:37.146
But Putin,

00:06:37.146 --> 00:06:38.064
I think, is a man

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.315
who cannot accept defeat

00:06:39.315 --> 00:06:40.733
and I think it was Mitch McConnell

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:41.317
who said today

00:06:41.317 --> 00:06:43.361
that unless he's pushed back,

00:06:43.694 --> 00:06:44.862
we can expect

00:06:44.862 --> 00:06:46.280
not only other dictators

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:46.989
to be emboldened,

00:06:46.989 --> 00:06:49.075
but this to turn into a very,

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.368
very expensive war,

00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:51.327
because we will continue

00:06:51.327 --> 00:06:52.328
to fight this from many,

00:06:52.328 --> 00:06:53.496
many more fronts.

00:06:53.496 --> 00:06:53.788
Yeah.

00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:54.747
And you know

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:55.873
what this offensive could look like.

00:06:55.873 --> 00:06:57.542
Of course, this is the crucial question.

00:06:57.542 --> 00:06:58.876
And Colonel Leighton,

00:06:58.876 --> 00:06:59.919
to this point

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:00.461
that Michael's

00:07:00.461 --> 00:07:03.339
making about the weaponry coming in.

00:07:03.548 --> 00:07:05.216
You've got a bipartisan group in Congress

00:07:05.216 --> 00:07:06.884
or he mentions that Senator McConnell

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:08.386
calling on the Biden administration

00:07:08.386 --> 00:07:09.637
to send F-16 fighter

00:07:09.637 --> 00:07:11.097
jets to Kiev as soon as possible.

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:12.265
Now, there's a gap of time,

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:13.307
as Michael points out. Right.

00:07:13.307 --> 00:07:14.350
Tanks are promised.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.726
Those Abrams tanks are not coming

00:07:15.726 --> 00:07:17.770
any time soon. They're just not ready.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.022
Biden has resisted the F-16s.

00:07:20.189 --> 00:07:21.149
And he said, you know,

00:07:21.149 --> 00:07:22.483
it would it would seriously escalate

00:07:22.483 --> 00:07:23.192
the situation.

00:07:23.192 --> 00:07:25.027
This has been from the very beginning.

00:07:25.027 --> 00:07:28.448
Did the US wait too long on this front?

00:07:28.531 --> 00:07:30.199
First for the F-16s for air?

00:07:31.659 --> 00:07:33.202
Yes, it absolutely did.

00:07:33.202 --> 00:07:33.369
Yeah.

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.037
And what should have happened

00:07:35.037 --> 00:07:37.123
is about two months into this war,

00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:39.667
starting from February of last year,

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.252
we should have started the training

00:07:41.252 --> 00:07:42.503
of F-16 pilots,

00:07:42.503 --> 00:07:43.546
or at least the transition

00:07:43.546 --> 00:07:46.174
of Ukrainian pilots into F-16.

00:07:46.424 --> 00:07:47.467
That would have then

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:49.135
given the Ukrainians time

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:51.179
to get familiar with the platform,

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:51.637
be able

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:52.930
to employ the platform

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.974
and also get familiar with the avionics.

00:07:55.224 --> 00:07:55.516
Plus,

00:07:55.516 --> 00:07:57.518
it would also have allowed them to train

00:07:57.518 --> 00:07:58.686
maintenance troops

00:07:58.686 --> 00:07:59.896
as well as the intelligence

00:07:59.896 --> 00:08:01.898
forces and radar operators

00:08:01.898 --> 00:08:02.315
in order

00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:03.608
to effectively employ

00:08:03.608 --> 00:08:04.650
this weapon system

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.777
in a combined arms manner.

00:08:06.777 --> 00:08:08.112
And that would be the kind of thing

00:08:08.112 --> 00:08:09.280
that would have been necessary.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.573
So at this point,

00:08:10.573 --> 00:08:11.908
you know, points out

00:08:11.908 --> 00:08:12.825
we're going to be racing

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:13.576
against the clock

00:08:13.576 --> 00:08:14.785
in several different ways.

00:08:14.785 --> 00:08:16.037
And that's going to be very tough

00:08:16.037 --> 00:08:16.996
on the Ukrainians.

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:18.247
And Michael, all in the U.S.

00:08:18.247 --> 00:08:19.832
has spent about $100 billion

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:21.876
pledged in aid to Ukraine.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:22.919
Zelensky

00:08:22.919 --> 00:08:24.837
said he's going to appoint a new leader

00:08:24.837 --> 00:08:26.589
to the anti-corruption agency there.

00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:27.256
He's fired.

00:08:27.256 --> 00:08:29.050
Now, there's been to sort of big purges,

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:29.759
one last summer

00:08:29.759 --> 00:08:31.677
and one recently of officials

00:08:31.677 --> 00:08:32.553
for corruption,

00:08:32.553 --> 00:08:33.221
most recently

00:08:33.221 --> 00:08:35.973
tied to were supplies, procurement.

00:08:36.807 --> 00:08:40.144
So how big of an issue is this?

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:41.854
Absolutely huge.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.439
Both inside and outside of Ukraine.

00:08:43.439 --> 00:08:44.106
Outside of Ukraine,

00:08:44.106 --> 00:08:45.525
the world is watching how Ukrainian

00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:47.235
is conducting itself militarily,

00:08:47.235 --> 00:08:49.570
but also spending these billions in aid.

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.197
And they have to be spent very carefully.

00:08:51.197 --> 00:08:51.906
So these

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:53.533
allegations come at a very bad time.

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:54.075
And by the way,

00:08:54.075 --> 00:08:54.617
they were uncovered

00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:55.993
by Ukrainian journalists.

00:08:55.993 --> 00:08:57.161
Secondly,

00:08:57.286 --> 00:08:58.454
I speak to a lot of Ukrainians

00:08:58.454 --> 00:08:59.956
both inside and outside of Ukraine.

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:00.665
And the one thing

00:09:00.665 --> 00:09:01.958
the one thing they want

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:03.042
other than Russia

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:04.544
being completely pushed out of Ukraine

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:05.461
and defeated,

00:09:05.461 --> 00:09:07.713
is that war on corruption to continue

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.091
to the very end. It will take some time.

00:09:10.091 --> 00:09:13.719
But I think that the Ukrainians

00:09:13.719 --> 00:09:14.845
who have, for example, left

00:09:14.845 --> 00:09:16.013
Ukraine millions of them,

00:09:16.013 --> 00:09:17.348
especially the young ones,

00:09:17.348 --> 00:09:18.182
the ones in high tech,

00:09:18.182 --> 00:09:18.724
for example,

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:20.768
want to come to back to Ukraine,

00:09:20.768 --> 00:09:22.228
which is build back better,

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:23.646
where corruption is no longer

00:09:23.646 --> 00:09:25.106
a daily fact of life.

00:09:25.106 --> 00:09:27.400
So Zelensky credit to him

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.359
for cracking down

00:09:28.359 --> 00:09:29.026
as he did,

00:09:29.026 --> 00:09:29.652
but there are still

00:09:29.652 --> 00:09:30.486
a lot of officials there

00:09:30.486 --> 00:09:31.237
and who were

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:32.697
allowed to gracefully resign.

00:09:32.697 --> 00:09:34.240
So he really has to come

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.157
down hard on this. All right.

